# Starfall Street, where Team Star keeps its five bases: a garage band's loud, cheerful bluster in E minor, an overdriven
# guitar chugging its power chords down the minor's rock turn (E, C, D, B) under a buzzing saw lead, a pumping synth
# bass and a kit that never sits still. Played by Starfall Street. Original composition for this game (plan 34 · PD5),
# in the modern sound.
